            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mwana w’umuntu, abo bantu bakimagije ibigirwamana vyabo mu mitima, kandi bashize imbere yabo igitsitaza kibatsinda mu bigabitanyo vyabo: none noshobora nte kw abo bogira ico bansiguza na kimwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero vugana na bo, ubabarire, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Umuntu wese wo mu nzu ya Isirayeli akimagiza ibigirwamana vyiwe mu mutima, agashira imbere yiwe igitsitaza kimutsinda mu bigabitanyo vyiwe, maz’ akaza gusiguza ūvugishwa nanje; jewe Uhoraho nzomwishura ibihwanye n’isinzi ry’ibigirwamana vyiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngw ab’inzu ya Isirayeli mbafatane ibiri mu mitima yabo, kuko bose twahubanywe kubg’ ibigirwamana vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
