        },
        {
          "text": "naho coba kirimwo Nowa na Daniyeli na Yobu, abo ukw ari batatu, ukugororoka kwabo kwokiza ayabo magara gusa, ni k’ Umwami Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
