              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naho coba kirimw’ abo bantu batatu, ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, nta we borokora, ar’ abahungu babo cank’ abakobga babo; ni bo borokoka gusa, arikw igihugu co coba amatongo. ",
