              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cank’ ico gihugu ni nagitērēra ikīza, nkakirekuriramw’ ubushangashirwe bganje busēsa ibitenga vy’ amaraso, nkakiranduramw’ abantu n’ibitungano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naho coba kirimwo Nowa na Daniyeli na Yobu, ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni k’ Umwami Uhoraho agize, nta we borokora, ar’ umuhungu wabo cank’ umukobga wabo; atar’ ayabo magara gusa bokiza, kubg’ ukugororoka kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
