              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ukw ari k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Mbega ntibizorushiriza kuba birtyo kuri Yerusalemu, igihe nzoharekurira ivyo bihano bihambaye ukw ari bine, ni vyo nkota n’inzara n’ibikōko vy’inkazi n’ ikīza, kugira ngo ndaharandure abantu n’ibitungano? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
